sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Chair
    participant UI as Browser (Record page)
    participant App as Django app
    participant STT as Azure AI Speech
    participant LLM as Azure OpenAI
    participant DB as Database

    Note over Chair,DB: Proof of concept: voice in, populated action items out

    Chair->>UI: Press Record
    UI->>UI: Capture microphone audio
    Note over Chair,UI: Team discusses issue and agrees action
    Chair->>UI: Press Stop
    UI->>App: Upload audio

    App->>STT: Transcribe audio
    STT-->>App: Transcript text

    App->>LLM: Transcript + action-item schema
    Note right of LLM: Extract segment, issue, action,<br/>owner, due date, anticipated result
    LLM-->>App: Structured action items (JSON)

    App->>DB: Save items as Proposed
    App-->>UI: Show populated to-do table

    Chair->>UI: Review and accept items
    UI->>App: Confirm
    App->>DB: Mark items Confirmed
    App-->>UI: Items saved
